[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0020","text":"……\n真的好漂亮啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0030","text":"……制作人大人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0040","text":"『学级会』\n写得就像习字范本一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0050","text":"……\n承蒙……过奖……不敢当……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0060","text":"不不，我可写不成这样\n都想再多看几眼了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0080","text":"……既然……您如此……盛赞……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0100","text":"……您觉得如何？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0110","text":"签名的时候经常看到，但这样欣赏也别有一番风味"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0120","text":"那么……\n接下来是制作人大人的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0130","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01120000_01_0140","text":"……不……\n没什么……"}]
